{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729210/extras/d13d122424d11e36a25e8ffd07fb7a16.avif?t=1771907582\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are the last descendant of a broken order, bound by an oath and kept alive by ancient shrines.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Oathbearer</i></strong> is a stylized Soulslike action-RPG about <strong>mastery, discovery, and consequence</strong> where every fight tests your skill and every ruin hides a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Awaits You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <i>Learn to Fight</i> \u2013 Weighty combat that rewards timing, parries, and smart stamina use.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <i>Wield Spells That Matter</i> \u2013 Fire, frost, and other elements not only win fights\u00a0 they reshape the world and reveal hidden paths.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <i>Face Colossal Bosses</i> \u2013 Multi-phase encounters in arenas that break and evolve mid-battle.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <i>Build Your Legend</i> \u2013 Equip unique weapons, upgrade gear, and specialize your playstyle \u2014 from juggernaut to nimble spellblade.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <i>Choose an Ending</i> \u2013 The oath you bear decides whether the Abyss is ended\u2026 or inherited.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Play Oathbearer?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you crave <i>challenging combat, unforgettable bosses, and dark fantasy atmosphere</i>\u00a0<strong><i>Oathbearer</i></strong> delivers a focused journey where every victory feels earned. The world is stylized for clarity and drama \u2014 striking silhouettes, bold lighting, and ruins that beg to be explored.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Now</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow development and play the demo at Steam Next Fest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729210/extras/1e30c4555080ce36dcc937c994bd4d72.avif?t=1771907582\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729210?t=1771907582","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729210/92698d4bd4b365932c669a110c7e6fc7ab5f867e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771907582","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729210/b6281cb87c611808a49c9f8775cdc68e127c788d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771907582","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729210/b6281cb87c611808a49c9f8775cdc68e127c788d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771907582","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729210/extras/7e276b8b19f277e69fb64214d0bf2fdf.avif?t=1771907582\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729210/extras/d13d122424d11e36a25e8ffd07fb7a16.avif?t=1771907582\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You are the last descendant of a broken order, bound by an oath and kept alive by ancient shrines.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Oathbearer</i></strong> is a stylized Soulslike action-RPG about <strong>mastery, discovery, and consequence</strong> where every fight tests your skill and every ruin hides a secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Awaits You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <i>Learn to Fight</i> \u2013 Weighty combat that rewards timing, parries, and smart stamina use.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <i>Wield Spells That Matter</i> \u2013 Fire, frost, and other elements not only win fights\u00a0 they reshape the world and reveal hidden paths.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <i>Face Colossal Bosses</i> \u2013 Multi-phase encounters in arenas that break and evolve mid-battle.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <i>Build Your Legend</i> \u2013 Equip unique weapons, upgrade gear, and specialize your playstyle \u2014 from juggernaut to nimble spellblade.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <i>Choose an Ending</i> \u2013 The oath you bear decides whether the Abyss is ended\u2026 or inherited.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Play Oathbearer?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you crave <i>challenging combat, unforgettable bosses, and dark fantasy atmosphere</i>\u00a0<strong><i>Oathbearer</i></strong> delivers a focused journey where every victory feels earned. The world is stylized for clarity and drama \u2014 striking silhouettes, bold lighting, and ruins that beg to be explored.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Now</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow development and play the demo at Steam Next Fest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729210/extras/1e30c4555080ce36dcc937c994bd4d72.avif?t=1771907582\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p>","developers":["MY DREAM GAME STUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}